     the Intel performance measurement architecture.

     These PMCs are documented in “Volume 3: System Programming Guide”, _I_A_-_3_2
     _I_n_t_e_l_® _A_r_c_h_i_t_e_c_t_u_r_e _S_o_f_t_w_a_r_e _D_e_v_e_l_o_p_e_r_'_s _M_a_n_u_a_l, Order Number
