     ITLB_Misses
             (Event 85H, Umask 00H) The number of instruction TLB misses.

     Instr_Decoded
             (Event D0H, Umask 00H) The number of instructions decoded.

     Instr_Ret
             (Event C0H, Umask 00H) (Alias "Instruction Retired") The number
