             (Event 26H) The number of L2 cache lines evicted.

     L2_M_Lines_In [,core=_c_o_r_e]
             (Event 25H) The number of L2 M state cache lines allocated.

     L2_M_Lines_Out [,core=_c_o_r_e] [,prefetch=_p_r_e_f_e_t_c_h]
